at MedVet Toledo\nEmergency Medicine\nRadiology\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nEmergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line\nServing more than 10,000 patients a year, the MedVet Toledo team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers in Northwest Ohio.\nWe serve as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced, comprehensive emergency care and radiology services. You’ll find caregivers with the expertise and state-of-the-art resources to diagnose and treat your beloved pet during critical times. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you each step of the way as we work to deliver the best outcome for your pet.\nMedVet Toledo Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nRadiology\nOur Hospital Leaders\nBarb Buford, DVM\nMedical Director\nAngie Heighton\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nSarah Anderson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChristopher Brouwer\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nBarb Buford\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAbigail Cone\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBailey A. DeGroat\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJessica DuVall\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nSydney Dudley\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMelissa Morgan\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlex Politis\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEmily Starck\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTiara L. Wiggins\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nPet Stories\n“\nVery kind staff to Peanut and me. I was worried about my fur baby because he was hurt. The staff put me at ease right away. They took good care of Peanut and he is now doing much better, thank you!!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\