      "address": "2921 Douglas Rd., Toledo, OH 43606",
      "description": "Emergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line   Serving more than 10,000 patients a year, the MedVet Toledo team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers in Northwest Ohio.   We serve as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced, comprehensive emergency care and radiology services. You’ll find caregivers with the expertise and state-of-the-art resources to diagnose and treat your beloved pet during critical times. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you each step of the way as we work to deliver the best outcome for your pet. ",
